                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Requiring all able-bodied Americans to work as a condition for receiving welfare would do more than reduce the deficit. It would bring people back into the economy, the source of prosperity and economic independence. A job is the best nutrition, housing, healthcare, education, child-care and general welfare program.\u2028\u2028Welfare reform would improve the well-being of low-income families and the overall economic health of the nation.",
